spice
* Components
V1 5 6 AC 1 SIN(0 1 1k)   ; AC voltage source vin
Vp 1 5 DC                 ; Polarized voltage source Vp
OpAmp 2 2 6 2 3 OPAMP     ; Op-amp with inverting terminal at node 2, non-inverting at node 6, output at node 3
RL 3 4 1k                 ; Resistor RL with 1k ohms
Vout 4 0 AC               ; Output voltage Vout

* Voltage Rails
VCC 2 0 DC 15             ; Positive voltage rail VCC
VEE 0 2 DC -15            ; Negative voltage rail VEE

* End of netlist